 "text": "Menominee County | Departments » Clerk\nGovernment\nAgendas & Minutes\nBoards & Committees\nEmployment\nForms & Documents\nMunicipalities\nServices\nDepartments\n9-1-1 (Central Dispatch)\nAdministration\nBuilding Codes\nClerk\nCounty Board of Commissioners\nCounty Fair\nCourts\nEmergency Management\nEqualization\nFriend of the Court\nLand Information Services (GIS)\nMenominee County Library\nMenominee Regional Airport\nParks & Recreation\nProsecuting Attorney\nRegister of Deeds\nRoad Commission\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nVeteran Services\nCommunity\nArea Information\nCUPPAD\nM & M Regional Guide\nMenominee Conservation District\nMenominee County 4-H\nMichigan Department of Health & Human Services\nMichigan State University - Extension\nNorthpointe Behavioral Health\nPublic Health - Delta & Menominee Counties\nUPCAP - Upper Peninsula Commission for Area Progress\nMore\nCalendar\nContact Us\nEmail Alerts\nFAQ\nLinks\nNews\nStaff Directory\n-->\nCLERK |\n|\n• General Information |\n|\n- |\n|\nStaff |\n|\n- |\n|\nForms & Documents |\n|\n- |\n|\nDoing Business As (DBA) |\n|\n- |\n|\nMilitary Discharges |\n|\n- |\n|\nNotary Public |\n|\n- |\n|\nContact Us |\n|\n• Vital Records |\n|\n• Elections |\n|\n• Circuit Court |\n|\n• Concealed Carry |\n|\n-->\n- Select Section --> CLERK General Information Staff Forms & Documents Doing Business As (DBA) Military Discharges Notary Public Contact Us Vital Records Elections Circuit Court Concealed Carry DEPARTMENTS HOME\nClerk\nDescription:\nThe County Clerk's office: Administers elections; orders and proofs ballots; produces vote totals reports and certifications; oversees voter registration in conjunction with the State of Michigan; produces voter books; trains precinct workers for elections.\nOversees the filing/recording of all vital statistics including birth, death, and marriage records; prepares certified records and copies. Issues marriage licenses and processes exemptions.\nActs as Clerk for County Board meetings, Gun Board, Election Commission; Special Election Scheduling Committee and Board of Canvassers. Serves as a member of the County Reapportionment Committee.\nServes as Clerk for Circuit Court Judges; receives and processes all Circuit Court filings; opens new cases.\nReceives and receipts all fines and fees for the Court and for other records.\nOversees County payroll, accounts payable and benefit program processing and activities, processing of health and life insurance forms and pension records and processing of workers compensation claims.\nProcesses personal protection orders.\nCommittees:\nApportionment Committee - The Menominee County Apportionment Committee is responsible for establishing County Commissioner districts within the County every 10 years after the census has been completed.\nContact: |\nMarc Kleiman - County Clerk\nPhone: (906) 863-9968\nClick here to email |\nMailing Address: |\n839 10th Avenue\nMenominee, MI 49858\nMap |\nPhysical Address: |\n839 10th Avenue - 2nd floor\nMenominee, MI 49858\nMap |\nHours: |\n8:00 am - 4:30 pm\nMonday through Friday\n(open during lunch hour)\nClosed on Holidays |\nCopyright © 2026 Menominee County\nGovernment - Menominee Michigan\nMenominee County Courthouse\n839 10th Avenue\nMenominee, MI 49858\n(906) 863-7779\nLegal Notice\nPrivacy Notice\nAcceptable Use Policy\nLinking Policy\nDesigned & Powered By:",
